  "description": "Stop wiring Serilog by hand. Add 3 lines of JSON and every ILogger<T> routes logs where they belong — errors to Email, info to Console, traces to Seq. 9 sinks, zero boilerplate. New in 5.0.6: request/response middleware now rents buffers from ArrayPool<char> — zero LOH allocations on large payloads.",
